    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d203">

                <pb facs="0245" n="235" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg235"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/4848: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Bucknell</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-08">December 8,
                        1943</date>.<lb/>[Received December 8—9 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8546. Department’s 7731, 7th. Although agreeing that main facts are to be used by
                    each of us in our own way the Foreign Office would like to know (for
                    Parliamentary reasons) before its release the complete text which will be
                    released in Washington. We take it there may be additions to the text in
                    Embassy’s 8478, 5th. On this account Foreign Office favors aiming at release at
                    a late hour on Friday rather than on Thursday. Regarding North Africa project
                    and Malin’s<anchor n="16" xml:id="d203-f1"/>
                    <pb facs="0246" n="236" xml:id="pg236"/> visit (see end of foreword of Embassy’s
                    8478) Foreign Office favors deferment of announcement unless Department
                    possesses subsequent approval from Madrid and theater commander,
                    respectively.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bucknell</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d203-f1" n="16" xml:id="d203-f1-content">
                <p>Patrick Malin, Vice-Director of the Intergovernmental Committee on Refugees.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
